      "index": 1,
      "markdown": "2\n\n4.\n\n$$\\begin{aligned} & \\frac{x^2 - 81}{x^2 - 25} \\cdot \\frac{x+5}{x+9} \\\\ &= \\frac{(x-9)(x+9)}{(x-5)(x+5)} \\cdot \\frac{(x+5)}{(x+9)} \\\\ &= \\frac{x-9}{x-5} \\end{aligned}$$\n\nAns: $\\boxed{\\frac{x-9}{x-5}}$\n\n5.\n\n$$\\frac{9}{x-9} - \\frac{18}{x^2} = 0$$\n\n$$9x^2 = 18(x-9)$$\n\n$$x^2 = 2x - 18$$\n\n$$x^2 - 2x + 18 = 0, \\quad x = \\frac{2 \\pm \\sqrt{4+72}}{2}$$\n\n$$x = \\frac{2 \\pm \\sqrt{76}}{2}$$\n\nAns: $\\boxed{\\frac{2 \\pm \\sqrt{76}}{2}}$\n\n6. $x(2x+5) \\geq 0, \\quad x=0, \\quad x=-\\frac{5}{2}$\n\nTesting intervals: $(-\\infty, -\\frac{5}{2}) \\rightarrow +$\n$(-\\frac{5}{2}, 0) \\rightarrow -$\n\nInclude points $(0, \\infty) \\rightarrow +$\n\nAns: $\\boxed{(-\\infty, -\\frac{5}{2}] \\cup [0, \\infty)}$\n\nCS CamScanner",
