      "markdown": "\u2462\n\n7. $$\\text{slope} = \\frac{6}{7}$$ , $$y\\text{-intercept} = 5$$\n\n$$y = mx + b$$ , $$y = \\frac{6}{7}x + 5$$\n\n$$\\text{Ans: } \\boxed{y = \\frac{6}{7}x + 5}$$\n\n8.\n\n$$f(z) = 5 - 4z^2$$\n\n$$f(-2) = 5 - 4(4) = -11$$\n\n$$f(0) = 5$$\n\n$$\\text{Net change: } 5 - (-11) = 16$$\n\n$$\\text{Average rate of change: } \\frac{16}{0 - (-2)} = \\frac{16}{2} = 8$$\n\n$$\\text{Ans: Net change} = 16$$\n\n$$\\text{Average rate} = 8$$\n\n9. $$g(x) = x^2 - x - 20$$\n\n$$= (x-5)(x+4)$$\n\n$$\\text{Zeros: } x = 5, -4$$\n\n$$\\text{Vertex } x = \\frac{1}{2}$$\n\nLooks like the graph in the $$[-7, 7]$$ window\n\n$$\\text{Ans: } \\boxed{[-7, 7] \\text{ by } [-25, 20]}$$\n\nCS\n\nCamScanner",
